{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39730","headline":"赠旌德吕明府 · 黄滔","name":"赠旌德吕明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渥洼步数太阿姿，争遣王侯不奉知。\n花作城池入官处，锦随刀尺少年时。\n两衙断狱兼留客，三考论功合树碑。\n须信隔帘看刺史，锦章朱绂已葳蕤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}